WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:09.040
Do you really want to change&nbsp;
your life for the better?&nbsp;

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.400
It can happen.
But it will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:24.640
require discipline and sacrifice&nbsp;
to get out of your comfort zone.&nbsp;

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:32.880
Because you cannot continue to do the same&nbsp;
things over and over and expect things to change.&nbsp;

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:35.560
They won't.
Albert Einstein&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:57.040
said insanity is doing the same thing over and&nbsp;
over again and expecting different results.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:04.960
Moving out of your comfort zone is the&nbsp;
first step you need to take to change.&nbsp;

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:09.200
And you should not waste any time.&nbsp;

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:16.880
Time passes in an instant.
You are but a vapor.&nbsp;

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:29.840
One day you're here and the next you are gone.
Life is short, so don't waste yours.

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:39.520
Far too many people come to the&nbsp;
end of their lives full of regret.&nbsp;

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:51.320
If only I did this, if only I did that.
They are alive but don't really live.&nbsp;

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:57.600
You are your own worst enemy.
If you have dreams they will stay&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:08.480
dreams if you don't actually plan and work for it.
How many years do you need to finally change?&nbsp;

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:14.000
Every year that passes you have New&nbsp;
Year resolutions and it goes well for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:21.640
the first few weeks, but then you&nbsp;
fall back into your old habits.&nbsp;

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:28.840
That is the problem because there should be&nbsp;
life resolutions and not New Year resolutions.&nbsp;

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:39.520
It must be a lifestyle change if you&nbsp;
truly want to change for the better.&nbsp;

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:46.640
It requires sacrificing temporary things&nbsp;
your flesh wants to do in order to reach&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:56.560
that which is most important in life.
This will change your habits and your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.560 --> 00:03:03.680
habits will change your routine and your routine&nbsp;
will bring you consistency and consistency will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:10.680
bring you lasting change.
But what if it is the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:17.560
wrong kind of lasting change?
What if what you think are your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:28.240
perfect dreams are not actually going to bring&nbsp;
you true purpose - fulfillment - and peace?&nbsp;

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:36.880
It might not be what you thought it would be.
What if, when you reach the peak of the mountain,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:43.080
that peak is not what you&nbsp;
thought it would be at all?&nbsp;

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:48.000
And what do you do next?
Search for another peak,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:56.160
then another and another... until you die?
What is the meaning then of life if all there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.160 --> 00:04:07.200
is to it .. is to be born, then to move&nbsp;
from one goal to the next and then die?&nbsp;

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:15.040
Where, hundreds of years from now,&nbsp;
nobody will even remember your name.&nbsp;

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:18.520
Here's the answer.
This temporary world you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:24.000
are living in is like the Matrix.
The real world that exists around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:33.960
you is the spiritual world, with angels,&nbsp;
demons, God, the devil, heaven and hell.&nbsp;

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:39.840
And this is the eternal world&nbsp;
that you will enter when you die.&nbsp;

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:47.720
This life is like a drop in the&nbsp;
ocean compared to eternal life.&nbsp;

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:54.120
You are mainly here to make a decision.
Given the breath of life, to be alive and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.120 --> 00:05:04.320
make a choice from your own self-determining&nbsp;
will, to choose the white pill or the black,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:15.720
to choose the light or the darkness.
To choose God or the devil.&nbsp;

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:19.640
And when you made your choice,&nbsp;
you will either be with God in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:29.600
heaven or with the devil in hell.
Because that is what you chose.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:36.680
In this short temporary world there is&nbsp;
only one pursuit that actually matters.&nbsp;

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:48.160
The pursuit of God, which is the pursuit of truth.
The Logos, the Alpha and the Omega.&nbsp;

00:05:48.160 --> 00:06:00.800
The God who made the world and everything in it,
being Lord of heaven and earth,&nbsp;

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:07.880
does not live in temples made by man nor is&nbsp;
he served by human hands as though he needed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:17.600
anything since He himself gives to all mankind&nbsp;
life and breath and everything and He made from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:27.280
one man every nation of mankind to live on all&nbsp;
the face of the earth having determined a lot of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:34.960
periods and the boundaries of their dwelling&nbsp;
place that they should seek God and perhaps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:42.600
feel their way toward Him.
And find Him yet He is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:58.400
actually not far from each one of us.
For in Him we live and move and have our being.

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:09.640
Stop wasting your life from this year forward&nbsp;
and focus on the one thing that matters most.&nbsp;

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:15.600
In my book, Bold Pursuit, a 90-day&nbsp;
devotional for men seeking the heart of God,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:23.560
I wrote on Day 82 on average&nbsp;
333,000 people die every day.&nbsp;

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:27.640
We don't know when we'll&nbsp;
be part of that statistic.&nbsp;

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:34.480
We can't take life for granted and&nbsp;
we can't ignore what comes next.

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:36.000
[Hebrews 9:27]

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:53.040
To prepare for the end of this life, we&nbsp;
must first make sure that we will spend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.040 --> 00:08:01.600
our next life in God's presence forever.
God gave you a self to think on your own.&nbsp;

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:08.840
A self-determining power by which you can&nbsp;
choose what you want to do with your life.&nbsp;

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:17.840
Why did God give this to you?
Because He wants you to choose to seek Him, to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:33.680
know Him personally, to love Him and to obey Him.
He is your creator and He loves you.&nbsp;

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:41.000
He wants you to bring yourself&nbsp;
to Him so he can bless you with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:51.200
his fullness and lead you forward in His will.
This is the key to living a life of total victory.&nbsp;

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:59.560
A life of complete surrender,
and a life of purpose,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:06.560
fulfillment, and unconditional peace.
You can pursue a lot of things from this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:14.120
year forward - a healthier body,&nbsp;
money, relationships, and power.&nbsp;

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:23.160
But, it is all temporary and will fade away.
Only one pursuit brings true satisfaction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:29.520
on earth, because only one&nbsp;
pursuit matters for eternity.&nbsp;

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:37.200
Becoming a true man of God.
So, what will you choose?&nbsp;

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:46.880
The black pill or the white pill?
The choice is yours.

